<h1>What changes in SFM 4.35?</h1>
<p class="standfirst">The rebuilt candidates include the energy-transfer fix, optional Label Gun success messages, tunnel cache notifications, French and Portuguese contributions, corrected recipe IDs and the Buffer loot correction. Archive evidence and new headless checks are separate from the retained game captures.</p>
<p class="review-scope"><strong>Candidate review, not a published release.</strong> The nine game captures retain the earlier Minecraft 1.21.1 experiment and its original artifact identities. New dedicated-server and resource checks are recorded separately below; these are not new graphical captures.</p>
